{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/Seedovia_GIF_1.gif?t=1745383339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seedovia is an action rogue-lite dungeon crawler where you create and discover combinations with your weapons (a.k.a. Seeds) by chaining them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/Godot_v4.4-stable_win64_h0QIpzCcuc.gif?t=1745383339\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Create unique seed combinations</i>: Discover many different seeds and chain them together to create your own chaos. There are hundreds of different combinations for you to try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Powerful talismans and passive upgrades</i>: Talismans and passive upgrades can be found during your endeavour. Finding these items can provide great benefits to your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Fight room after room</i>: Engage in combat, earn your reward, and move on to the next room. The rooms you enter are chosen at random, so you will never experience the same run twice. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636730?t=1745383339","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636730?t=1745383339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/b7ed58e23471bae31179dff3e7ea5cc2cdca7b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745383339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/b7ed58e23471bae31179dff3e7ea5cc2cdca7b5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745383339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/Seedovia_GIF_1.gif?t=1745383339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seedovia is an action rogue-lite dungeon crawler where you create and discover combinations with your weapons (a.k.a. Seeds) by chaining them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/Godot_v4.4-stable_win64_h0QIpzCcuc.gif?t=1745383339\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Create unique seed combinations</i>: Discover many different seeds and chain them together to create your own chaos. There are hundreds of different combinations for you to try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Powerful talismans and passive upgrades</i>: Talismans and passive upgrades can be found during your endeavour. Finding these items can provide great benefits to your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Fight room after room</i>: Engage in combat, earn your reward, and move on to the next room. The rooms you enter are chosen at random, so you will never experience the same run twice. </p></li></ul>","developers":["ab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/3726ed7b0e651b3c5090f3d6a068165800ac3682/header.jpg?t=1745383339","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123765,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123765/movie480.mp4?t=1745383337","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123765/movie_max.mp4?t=1745383337"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_